<problem>
<!-- <title>Compute iterates of discrete dynamical system</title> -->

<setup>

<select name="x0" numToSelect="2" withReplacement="true"> 1/6 5/6 1/2 1/3 2/3 1/4  3/4 1/5 2/5 3/5 4/5</select>
<function name="f">$x0[2] x(1-x)</function>

<math name="ans1" simplify="numbers">$$f($x0[1])</math>
<math name="ans2" simplify="numbers">$$f($ans1)</math>
<math name="ans3" simplify="numbers">$$f($ans2)</math>
<math name="ans4" simplify="numbers">$$f($ans3)</math>

</setup>


<p>Compute the next four points of the solution to the discrete dynamical system

<md>
  <mrow>x_{n+1}\amp = $x0[2] x_n (1-x_n)</mrow>
  <mrow>x_0\amp = $x0[1].</mrow>
</md>
</p>



<p>Include at least 4 significant digits in your answer.</p>
<p>
<m>x_1 =</m> 
<answer name="answer1">
<award symbolicEquality="true" simplifyOnCompare="numbers" allowedErrorInNumbers="0.001">$ans1 </award>
<award credit="0.5" symbolicEquality="true" simplifyOnCompare="numbers" allowedErrorInNumbers="0.01" feedbackCodes="numericalerror">$ans1 </award>
<award credit="0.25" symbolicEquality="true" simplifyOnCompare="numbers" allowedErrorInNumbers="0.1" feedbackCodes="numericalerror">$ans1 </award>
</answer>
</p>
$answer1.feedbacks


